.TH proc_version 5 2026\-02\-08 "Linux man\-pages (未リリース)" 
.SH 名前
/proc/version \- kernel version
.SH 説明
.TP 
\fI/proc/version\fP
This string identifies the kernel version that is currently running.  It
includes the contents of \fI/proc/sys/kernel/ostype\fP,
\fI/proc/sys/kernel/osrelease\fP, and \fI/proc/sys/kernel/version\fP.  For
example:
.IP
.in +4n
.EX
Linux version 1.0.9 (quinlan@phaze) #1 Sat May 14 01:51:54 EDT 1994
.EE
.in
